https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-19T23:29:49-08:00","id":1432750,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24179_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24179\" data-vbnamecard=\"24179\">Grimmi05</a> - Do like me - Back both books! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> No need to choosing then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Both looks like great products that expend <b>Scion</b> line.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T00:50:34-08:00","id":1432756,"title":"","content":"Short sum-up of Dragons Flights:<br /> \u2018\u2022 <b>Draqs </b>\u2013 Grouped mostly in the Middle East, these Dragons seek vengeance for the loss of Tiamat, who they consider the progenitor of all Dragons.<br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Joka </b>\u2013 Dragons found primarily in northern and western Africa and known for their intense hunger. Their hunger has driven them toward ambitions, and a return to a time before Gods.<br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Lindwurms </b>\u2013 European dragons are grouped as Lindwurms, though it is a term primarily used for Dragons from the Nordic nations, as well as Eastern European dragons. They seek knowledge and power in lieu of lost memories.<br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>L\u00f3ng </b>\u2013 L\u00f3ng encompass mostly east Asian Dragons, though also includes Polynesia and the Philippines. This Flight is the largest and most disparate, though they seek fame, glory, and to replace the pantheons.<br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Naga</b> \u2013 The Naga are primarily located in southeast Asia, though they have members across Asia and Europe as well. Naga seek knowledge and a way to reopen their Terra Incognita where members of their Flight are trapped.<br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Serpents </b>\u2013 Serpents are mostly found in the Americas, though also in the Pacific Islands and Australia. These Dragons care about the natural parts of The World and humanity. They seek to teach and uplift humanity to cleanse The World, or otherwise remove those who can\u2019t be taught.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T00:58:31-08:00","id":1432758,"title":"","content":"Stretch goals indicate a new Flight made of legendary turtles and I'm glad this KS is doing well cause I NEED this <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T05:14:22-08:00","id":1432773,"title":"","content":"I like the Flights. There seems to be a lot of room for diverse motivations and how those might manifest.<br /> <br /> And I also want turtles.<br /> <br /> if there ends up being a second additional Flight, I'm hoping maybe for sea monsters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T06:11:10-08:00","id":1432777,"title":"","content":"For <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> fans - <b>Scion: Dragon</b>, from my reading of Introduction preview, seems a lot like <b>Beast: Primordial</b>, minus problematic elements of it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( Hungers, teaching 'Lessons', all those stuff. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T06:14:58-08:00","id":1432779,"title":"","content":"The Flights are fascinating!<br /> Very much looking forward to seeing Dragon Magic!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 01-20-2021, 09:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T08:14:43-08:00","id":1432790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1429505-scion-dragon-masks-of-mythos-kickstarter?p=1432750#post1432750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> - Do like me - Back both books! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> No need to choosing then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Both looks like great products that expend <br /> <b>Scion</b> line.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I wish I had that kinda cash. I am holding at the $5 mark till I get more from each book and I make my final choice. Right now dragons are narrowly winning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T08:52:29-08:00","id":1432793,"title":"","content":"Am I reading it right? Dragons created REPTILIAN RACE before humanity?! \ud83d\ude2e<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.aszdziennik.pl/43f656e1e619efe2788661aff3e4ddda,1094,0,0,0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> \u2018Dragons marveled at the rapidity of change, the miracle of new growth, and the brevity of mortal life. Soon, creation perfected its formulae and birthed children of scale and claw to The World. <br /> (\u2026) So similar were these creatures to Dragons, the ancient ones called them children and in the mess of living within all time at once, some Dragons forgot they did not create these children. Life in this blossoming world was peaceful. At first, Dragons lived alongside their children, their influence near imperceptible to the young creatures who wanted nothing more than to hunt and eat. However, slowly, generation by generation, the Dragon\u2019s children became more aware of their presence. The first great cultures grew from this newfound awareness modeled after the titanic Dragons watching over everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T11:36:23-08:00","id":1432808,"title":"","content":"See, I read that and went &quot;Oh, the dinosaurs&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T14:12:24-08:00","id":1432834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1429505-scion-dragon-masks-of-mythos-kickstarter?p=1432808#post1432808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See, I read that and went &quot;Oh, the dinosaurs&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I saw it as both. The Ophidian Denizens can't shapeshift, but I can definitely see a lot of them inspiring the World's less noxious conspiracy theories...which are equally wrong, given how the majority of &quot;lizard people&quot; are really &quot;humans who are valid targets for Bequeathment from living Dragons.&quot; Who likely don't know it themselves and are likely too large to be anything resembling a secret cabal, since it's an ethnic group more than it is a family. Sort of like being descended from Ghenghis Khan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T14:28:45-08:00","id":1432837,"title":"","content":"Oh, Fireborn I though you died and never would arise again...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T14:30:31-08:00","id":1432839,"title":"","content":"I may have had my mind go a slightly different direction on that.<br /> <br /> *Cues up Terrible Thunderlizards*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T14:48:53-08:00","id":1432845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1429505-scion-dragon-masks-of-mythos-kickstarter?p=1432837#post1432837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, Fireborn I though you died and never would arise again...</div> </div> </div> </div>I forgot about Fireborn, but there is a lot of thematical overlap with Scion: Dragon. Like direct inspiration overlap.<br /> *<b>NOT COPYING OR STEALING IDEAS, BUT SEVERAL CONCEPTS RESEMBLE EACH OTHER CLOSELY*</b><br /> Though the espionage angle is new, and it has been adapted to the World as well. Plus a lot more politics are implied the Flights.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T16:58:36-08:00","id":1432858,"title":"","content":"SO the little mini update on Mythos have a couple of gods. Azathoth and Nyarlathotep. ABout what I expected from both. Though I wished they refrenced Azathoth other name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T19:49:49-08:00","id":1432876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1429505-scion-dragon-masks-of-mythos-kickstarter?p=1432773#post1432773\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the Flights. There seems to be a lot of room for diverse motivations and how those might manifest.<br /> <br /> And I also want turtles.<br /> <br /> if there ends up being a second additional Flight, I'm hoping maybe for sea monsters.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If I can't make a Scion of godzilla I know what I'm putting up for the vault...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T20:07:34-08:00","id":1432877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1429505-scion-dragon-masks-of-mythos-kickstarter?p=1432876#post1432876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I can't make a Scion of godzilla I know what I'm putting up for the vault...</div> </div> </div> </div>Godzilla is heavily implied to be a reincarnation of a water Ryu gone horribly wrong. So it is entirely possible to have yet another reincarnation as a player character, struggling with inhuman memories and trying to resist the temptation to shuck off mortal flesh and go stomping down to the city you have loved and hated...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12958-raz_fox","name":"Raz_Fox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key"